{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/668133-about-gift-of-elementals","id":668133,"title":"About Gift of Elementals","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-17T06:10:52-07:00","id":668133,"title":"About Gift of Elementals","content":"I know that Gift of Elementals grant a level of Influence equal to Renown dots, but what exactly can do a Werewolf?<br /> <br /> The first point of influence states:<br /> <br /> &quot;The spirit can enhance its sphere of influence; it can add to the Defense of a beneficiary,<br /> make an emotion stronger, an animal or plant healthier, or an object more robust, gaining the<br /> spirit\u2019s Rank in Health or Structure. This Influence can shift the Resonant Condition to Open for<br /> its duration. The cost is 1 Essence.&quot;<br /> <br /> For example, a werewolf can use the element to increase his own Defense?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7884-lastdreamer81","name":"lastdreamer81","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T06:17:29-07:00","id":668157,"title":"","content":"Only if they're made from that element. You won't really get that much use out of it at one dot.<br /> <br /> We've had some other threads thinking of ideas to do with them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428559-gift-of-the-elementals-question\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/471285-on-the-innovative-use-of-